WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:01.600
Deal

00:03.200 --> 00:04.120
But

00:04.200 --> 00:05.867
I have one more condition

00:07.200 --> 00:09.200
That imperial jade seal

00:10.120 --> 00:11.520
That seal

00:11.960 --> 00:14.520
I lost it when I was driven out

00:14.600 --> 00:15.960
Now

00:16.040 --> 00:18.040
I don't know where it is

00:18.160 --> 00:19.560
Forget it

00:20.320 --> 00:21.720
This deal is done

00:22.400 --> 00:24.000
Thank you, Your Highness

00:33.080 --> 00:34.040
Your Highness

00:34.120 --> 00:35.720
Should we give him the full amount?

00:35.880 --> 00:37.040
If we give too little

00:37.160 --> 00:38.480
They might not put in effort

00:38.640 --> 00:39.640
If we give too much

00:39.760 --> 00:41.640
They might have other ideas

00:43.280 --> 00:44.947
Give them six hundred sets

00:45.280 --> 00:46.680
In batches

00:47.480 --> 00:48.760
Yes

